 false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161917629", "author": {"steamid": "76561198060136207", "personaname": "SpaceCowboy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198060136207/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3262, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 850, "playtime_at_review": 2314, "last_played": 1787801575, "avatar": "c78e87c68a89fcdd6c895f2b6b13474085a9c5ab"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1711928348, "timestamp_updated": 1711928348, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161917574", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010834212", "personaname": "Arkinite", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198010834212/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 22955, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14769, "last_played": 1783998211, "avatar": "97e463a36f2693f6158631fb69c4074694019c20"}, "language": "english", "review": "I want to start with what everyone knows- The launch was not great, BUT it was handled promptly and it was handled well for the most part.\n\nThat however does not excuse how much ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ this game can throw with a single hand, and it's not afraid to do it. It will ♥♥♥♥ you at the drop of a hat, and that's even if you're doing everything right.\n\nAll in all the game runs real smooth and well and all that stuff you readers care about, but the AI in this game is questionable at best, and I assure you, reader, that is putting it *VERY* lightly.\n\nA message to any Arrowhead employees, or even maybe a CEO:\n\nFix your ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ game's AI, being literally locked in to an animation only to get pelted by 30+ rockets from a single bot (The worst offender BY FAR.) is not fun, it's not even slightly fair, and it's not a wise game decision. I'll either see you guys on the other side of this, or I'll uninstall due to how imbalanced and thus not fun it's become. I want to like your game, hell I did like it for the first few weeks. The problem is the inconsistency, all the difficulty modifier does is increase the density of enemy spawns (YAY MORE GARBAGE AI TO *TRY* TO MAKE YOUR WAY THROUGH OR AWAY FROM, DOESNT MATTER THOUGH BECAUSE THEY CAN SEE YOU THROUGH ANYTHING AND IN A LOT OF CASES CAN EVEN SHOOT YOU THROUGH \"SOLID\" TERRAIN THEY LIKE TO CALL COVER.) Seriously, fix your ♥♥♥♥.\n\nThis game is easily a 9/10 for me IF they can fix the ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ AI, until then, it dredges around in the 3.5 area, which is a shame given how nice the guns feel, and how the bugs are really fun to murder even though I'd rather close my testicles in car door instead of fighting the bots ever again. (funny thing is they were fun at launch, not anymore though! Thanks, Arrowhead! :D) \n\nMake a wise decision, for once, and for your fans Arrowhead.\n\nNot very hopeful,\n\nSomeone who bought the whole shebang at launch.", "timestamp_created": 1711928281, "timestamp_updated": 1711928336, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 15, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "161917462", "author": {"steamid": "76561198835127609", "personaname": "Jooobjoob1", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198835127609/", "num_games_owned": 91, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1939, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 721, "last_played": 1739015915, "avatar":